  "editorial_title": "Dry Bulk Rates Ride Rising Trade",
  "nutshell": [
    "- Baltic dry bulk earnings strengthened sharply across every",
    "- vessel segmen.  (Page 1)",
    "- Capesize rates led gains, supported by stronger iron ore vol-",
    "- umes . (Page 1)",
    "- Grain trade surged, broadening demand beyond traditional",
    "- major bulk commodities .  (Page 1)",
    "- Australia, Brazil and Guinea strengthened long-haul cargo",
    "- demand significantly globally.  (Page 1)",
    "- Crude oil rose about 1% on Friday, but still recorded a more",
    "- than 7% decline over the week. (Page 8)"
